},{"year":2022,"applied":637},{"year":2023,"applied":4708},{"year":2024,"applied":1887},{"year":2025,"applied":3959}],"origin":[{"year":2015,"applied":2312},{"year":2016,"applied":3735},{"year":2017,"applied":5808},{"year":2018,"applied":9985},{"year":2019,"applied":8261},{"year":2020,"applied":3364},{"year":2021,"applied":3514},{"year":2022,"applied":6059},{"year":2023,"applied":24838},{"year":2024,"applied":18409},{"year":2025,"applied":97267}]},"idmc":[{"year":2011,"total":350000},{"year":2012,"total":350000},{"year":2013,"total":383000},{"year":2014,"total":1498000},{"year":2015,"total":1697000},{"year":2016,"total":1847000},{"year":2017,"total":1899000},{"year":2018,"total":1869000},{"year":2019,"total":1352000},{"year":2020,"total":1436000},{"year":2021,"total":1369000},{"year":2022,"total":1475000},{"year":2023,"total":1121000},{"year":2024,"total":945000},{"year":2025,"total":945000}],"footnotes":[{"year":null,"population_type":"STA","text":"The reported figure is a preliminary estimate of persons of undetermined nationality by UNHCR. The estimate is based on the UNHCR 2018 statelessness study which documents specific profiles of groups at risk of statelessness in South Sudan.","view":"asylum"},{"year":null,"population_type":"STA","text":"This newly reported figure is a preliminary estimate of persons of undetermined nationality by UNHCR. The estimate is based on the UNHCR 2018 statelessness study which documents specific profiles of groups at risk of statelessness in South Sudan.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2015,"population_type":"IDP","text":"IDP figure in South Sudan includes 105,000 people who are in an IDP-like situation.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2015,"population_type":"IDP","text":"An unknown number of refugees and asylum-seekers from South Sudan may be included under Sudan (in absence of separate statistics for both countries). IDP figure in South Sudan includes 105,000 people who are in an IDP-like situation.","view":"origin"},{"year":2024,"population_type":"STA","text":"The reported figure is a preliminary estimate of persons of undetermined nationality by UNHCR. The start-year estimate is based on the UNHCR 2018 statelessness study which documents specific profiles of groups at risk of statelessness in South Sudan. During 2024, 19,561 people at risk of statelessness were assessed and issued nationality certificates. 27,411 additional people of undetermined nationality status were identified.","view":"asylum"},{"year":2025,"population_type":"STA","text":"The reported figure is a preliminary estimate of persons of undetermined nationality by UNHCR. A previous estimate of 18,000 was revised, as UNHCR expects that more people in South Sudan will need help confirming their nationality in the future. Therefore, at the end of 2025, about 60,600 additional people are estimated to be at risk of statelessness and in need of support. These figures do not represent the number of stateless people, but rather those UNHCR expects to assist in confirming their nationality.","view":"asylum"}],"sources":["unhcr_countries","unhcr_population","unhcr_demographics","unhcr_idmc","unhcr_solutions","unhcr_asylum_applications","unhcr_footnotes","wpp_population","natural_earth"]}
